docs {
Feed dengan filter kategori chips (mobile#193, 37-api-activity-feed.md).

Query `category` enum: all (default, tanpa filter) | search_miss | correction
| announcement | joined. Nilai di luar enum = 400 (bukan diam-diam all).

Mapping kategori -> kind event DB (FEED_CATEGORY_KINDS, merge-activity.ts):
- all        -> null (TANPA filter)
- search_miss-> search_miss
- correction -> contribution_image/audio/pron/example + suggestion_created/
               suggestion_applied/suggestion_selfapply
- announcement -> announcement
- joined     -> user_joined (wire kind: welcome)

Filter dieksekusi server-side: 1 query dengan kondisi kind IN (...) + keyset
cursor yang sama. Rows read dijaga index composite
activity_events_kind_feed_idx (kind, occurred_at, id).

200: bentuk identik dengan get-activity.bru (kind wire tidak berubah).
}

meta {
  name: Get Activity Feed - category (chips #193)
  seq: 7
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/activity?limit=20&category=joined
  body: none
  auth: none
}

tests {
  test("200: semua item sesuai kategori joined (wire kind welcome)", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.success).to.equal(true);
    expect(res.body.data).to.be.an("array");
    for (const item of res.body.data) {
      expect(item.kind).to.equal("welcome");
      expect(item).to.not.have.property("email");
    }
  });
}
